# Secrets: never commit Supabase keys or env files
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
supabase/.temp/
supabase/.branches/
**/SupabaseSecrets*.asset
**/SupabaseSecrets*.asset.meta
# Tools > Supabase > Create or Select Secrets File puts the secrets file in Assets/Resources;
# the folder holds nothing else, so its .meta stays local too.
CapstoneGame/Assets/Resources.meta

# Unity test output: results files from local runs, and CI artifacts
test-results*.xml
*TestResults*.xml
artifacts/
CodeCoverage/
